## What is not here

- **No MCP server.** `/.well-known/mcp-manifest.json` is a 404 on this domain and on the studio, and will stay one until there is a server behind it.
- **No API on this domain.** Everything a machine can call lives on the studio, and [its own llms.txt](https://studio.prospektor.ai/llms.txt) is the whole list.
- **No trial clock.** Nothing free above asks for a card or expires; the subscription you pay for up front and take the money back if it disappoints.
- **No sales call.** The price is on the page and checkout is the next click.
